---
// Hero · same XL display + accent split as <deck-cover>, but on a marketing page.
---

<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">A tiny Lit Web Components framework</p>

    <h1 class="title">
      Web slides<br />
      that <span class="accent">stay alive</span>.
    </h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Write a deck as plain HTML. Open <code>index.html</code> in a browser. No build step,
      no toolchain, no <code>node_modules</code> to resurrect five years from now.
    </p>

    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#quickstart">Get started</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/demo/">Watch the 14-slide tour →</a>
    </div>

    <ul class="meta">
      <li><strong>~11 KB</strong> gzip · framework total</li>
      <li><strong>23</strong> components</li>
      <li><strong>0</strong> build steps for deck authors</li>
      <li><strong>MIT</strong></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--on-dark-text);
    padding: var(--sp-7) var(--sp-5) var(--sp-7);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 85%, rgba(240, 112, 32, 0.10) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(0, 200, 160, 0.08) 0%, transparent 45%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-micro);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--on-dark-soft);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }
  .title {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: var(--fs-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--on-dark-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }
  .title .accent { color: var(--mango); }
  .lead {
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 60ch;
    color: var(--on-dark-soft);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-5);
  }
  .lead code {
    background: rgba(232, 228, 240, 0.10);
    color: var(--on-dark-text);
  }
  .ctas { display: flex; gap: var(--sp-3); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: var(--sp-6); }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    font: 700 var(--fs-body)/1 var(--sans);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover { text-decoration: none; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn.primary { background: var(--mango); color: var(--dark); }
  .btn.ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--on-dark-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--on-dark-border);
  }
  .meta {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    list-style: none;
    padding: var(--sp-4) 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--on-dark-border);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    color: var(--on-dark-muted);
  }
  .meta strong { color: var(--on-dark-text); font-weight: 700; }
</style>
